=2 Walkthrough
* Speak to {n:Kubhe Ijyuhla} at (I-8) in the **Serpentking Square** to begin the Quest. The rest of the Quest involves running around Whitegate and watching cutscenes.
* Head to the (G/H-10) boundary and exit into {z:Wajaom Woodlands} through the **Ironbound Gate**. As you zone, you'll watch the cutscene.
* Head back to {n:Kubhe|Kubhe Ijyuhla}, who started the Quest, for another cutscene.
* Speak with {n:Ratihb} inside the **Shararat Teahouse** at (J-12).
** If the cutscene does not involve Foudeel and Wahboud, speak to him again for the correct cutscene.
